# A parameter whose CALLER evidence says boxed and whose BODY says numeric —
# the shape that broke DMG's BUILD while the census said "yes".
#
# THE POINT OF THIS FIXTURE is the difference between the two halves of the
# envelope claim. `iei`'s second write is an index read, so it is boxed
# evidence; the call site makes f's `idx` a Value* parameter. The body then
# increments idx, and the seeded numeric inference classified it numeric FROM
# ITS OWN ASSIGNMENTS — the merge overwrote the ptype's verdict, the signature
# said `Value* eig_idx` while every body emission said double, and gcc
# rejected the C. No binary, no AOT: diagnostic.
#
# That is the CLAUDE.md hazard verbatim (declared type and emission must share
# one inference), and it is how DMG — the flagship, 5.70 MHz, 136% of real
# hardware — sat "in the envelope" by census while failing to build: the
# census TRANSPILES, and its own header warns that transpiles is not compiles.
# This fixture builds and runs, so the suite carries what the census cannot.

define f(events, idx, cap) as:
    applied is 0
    loop while idx < (len of events):
        applied is applied + 1
        idx is idx + 1
    return [idx, applied]

evs is [1, 2]
iei is 0
r is f of [evs, iei, 10]
iei is r[0]
print of iei
r is f of [evs, iei, 10]
print of (r[1])
